{"id":"hhyzfqwlnoezrva3d0pydcwm2","title":"3.5万亿医保基金，明年为这些新药“买单”","originalTitle":null,"summary":"2026年国家基本医保目录新增107个药品，其中1类新药51个，总数增至3331个。瑞基奥仑赛作为首个纳入医保的CAR-T产品，医保定价为28.86万元，患者自费价将降至10万元以下。此外，信达生物的玛仕度肽和诺和诺德的依柯胰岛素司美格鲁肽等4款GLP-1降糖药也首次纳入医保。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"36氪"},"links":{"original":"https://36kr.com/p/4070947046675589?f=rss"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T00:30:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:30.334Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:30.334Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["监管批准"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"8df1e6bb-8d91-493d-9c51-ed9d8256f811","title":"国家医保局2026版目录新增107种创新药 药明巨诺CAR-T疗法纳入医保自付降至10万内"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"8df1e6bb-8d91-493d-9c51-ed9d8256f811","title":"国家医保局2026版目录新增107种创新药 药明巨诺CAR-T疗法纳入医保自付降至10万内"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulatory-approval","name":"监管批准"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fLIlqEssvmhk","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}